# PC card team-farm (BENCH-194, TMODE-41..44): the confirm, arm c@J@ (@J@ = bb, the A/A, or fx, the tmtab build of the picked table work/team-farm-pick.java), on the picked teams (work/team-farm-confirm.txt), 12 fresh seeds from 9500, against master (the aa build). Template: tfcprep writes work/team-farm-c@J@.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
